# Frontend environment — copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) if you need to
# override the defaults. Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_,
# and only at BUILD time (`npm run build` / `npm run dev`).
#
# Local dev default (backend on port 4000):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api
#
# On Render (Static Site) set the same variable in the dashboard BEFORE the
# first build — point it at the deployed API, including the /api suffix:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://intellar-admin-api.onrender.com/api
# Changing it later requires a manual redeploy (clear build cache) to rebake.
